---
export const prerender = true;
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>Relay Zones</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/ui/hemi.png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/game.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <section id="select">
    <div class="select-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" id="zone-count">Five Hemi stages</p>
      <h1>Pick a map</h1>
      <p class="eyebrow" id="story-tagline" hidden></p>
      <p class="lede" id="story-intro" hidden></p>
      <p class="lede">
        Pick Hemigo or Orami, then pick a map. Orami stays locked until all five rises are clear.
        Space jumps. Hold Ctrl or Down to crouch. E swings, chops, or fires.
        The mouse wheel cycles weapons you have found. Hold Q to raise a shield.
        F confirms the post at the top. The grass rise has no armor and no spark.
        Its relay is two steps, one hop each. The spark is on the mountain rise.
        That rise also has a chest plate. Helms are on the tundra and the volcano.
        I pauses the run so you can equip what you have found.
        An open gate brings you back here.
      </p>
      <p id="select-note" class="select-note" hidden></p>
      <div class="runners" id="runners">
        <button type="button" class="runner is-picked" data-hero="hemigo" id="pick-hemigo" aria-pressed="true">
          <img src="/assets/hemigo/portrait.png" alt="" />
          <span class="runner-name">Hemigo</span>
          <span class="runner-role">Empty hands. The sword and the shield are on the ground. Armor comes later.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="runner is-locked" data-hero="orami" id="pick-orami" aria-pressed="false">
          <img src="/assets/orami/portrait.png" alt="" />
          <span class="runner-name">Orami</span>
          <span class="runner-role">Locked until all five rises are clear.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="zones">
        <button type="button" id="start-hemi" class="zone-pick hemi">
          <span class="zone-kicker">Hemi <span class="zone-clear" hidden>Clear</span></span>
          <span class="zone-title">Hemi Rise</span>
          <span class="zone-best" hidden></span>
          <span class="zone-blurb">Open grass. No armor and no spark. The ditches change width as you go, then two steps, and one hop clears each. Confirm the relay, then face the boss behind the gate. Health is five Hemi marks.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="start-wart" class="zone-pick wart">
          <span class="zone-kicker">Hemi <span class="zone-clear" hidden>Clear</span></span>
          <span class="zone-title">Hemi Span</span>
          <span class="zone-best" hidden></span>
          <span class="zone-blurb">Warm stone mountains. The pads change height as you go. The Hemi spark is on the floor before the shaft, and the shaft needs that second hop. Chest plates are here too. No helm yet.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="start-cart" class="zone-pick cart">
          <span class="zone-kicker">Hemi <span class="zone-clear" hidden>Clear</span></span>
          <span class="zone-title">Hemi Deep</span>
          <span class="zone-best" hidden></span>
          <span class="zone-blurb">Jungle canopy. A low roof, then another, and the floor keeps changing between them. A wisp waits near the gate. No new armor here. Gear you already picked up comes with you.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="start-gale" class="zone-pick gale">
          <span class="zone-kicker">Hemi <span class="zone-clear" hidden>Clear</span></span>
          <span class="zone-title">Hemi Gale</span>
          <span class="zone-best" hidden></span>
          <span class="zone-blurb">Icy winter tundra. Sliding spans of different lengths, shelves that change height, a gold helm on the ground, and skimmers that fire down on a slant.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="start-crown" class="zone-pick crown">
          <span class="zone-kicker">Hemi <span class="zone-clear" hidden>Clear</span></span>
          <span class="zone-title">Hemi Crown</span>
          <span class="zone-best" hidden></span>
          <span class="zone-blurb">Volcanic mountains. Pads, a bridge, the spark, a low roof, and a high step, then the peak changes again. A blue helm is on the ground. Skimmers keep firing on the diagonal.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="pilot-card">
        <div>
          <div class="armory">
            <figure id="arm-sword">
              <img src="/assets/gold/18.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Sword</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure id="arm-axe">
              <img src="/assets/weapons/axe.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Axe</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure id="arm-rifle">
              <img src="/assets/weapons/rifle.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Rifle</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <div class="armory armor-row">
            <figure>
              <img src="/assets/gold/06.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Gold helm · harder hits</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <img src="/assets/gold/10.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Gold plate · harder hits</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <img src="/assets/blue/01.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Blue helm · faster run</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <img src="/assets/blue/09.png" alt="" />
              <figcaption>Blue plate · faster swings</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-stat">Space jumps. Hold Ctrl or Down to crouch. E attacks. Hold Q to guard. Mouse wheel cycles weapons. F or right-click confirms. I opens armor.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="controls-blurb kb">
        Desktop: A D or arrows move · Space jump · Ctrl, S, or Down crouch · E attack · hold Q shield · mouse wheel swaps weapons · F uses · I armor. Push the stick down to crouch.
      </p>
      <p class="controls-blurb touch-only">
        Thumb stick on the left. Guard, Jump, Hit, and Use on the right. Bag is in the top bar.
      </p>
      <div class="wallet-row">
        <button type="button" id="wallet-connect" class="quit wallet-btn">Connect wallet</button>
        <p id="wallet-note" class="wallet-note">Best clears stay in this browser, one score for each stage. The list keeps a high score for each Hemi wallet on each stage. Connecting does not sign or spend.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="select-chips" class="chips" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div id="best-score" class="best-score" hidden></div>
      <div class="reset-row">
        <button type="button" id="reset-open" class="quit reset-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog">Reset journey</button>
        <p class="wallet-note">Forget your past and start again from scratch. Clears this browser's clears, gear, and best scores. Orami locks again. The online high-score list is not touched.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="fine">
        Grass, warm mountains, jungle, icy tundra, then volcanic peaks. Each rise is longer than the last, and the ground keeps changing as you cross it: short hops, then pads, a crouch, sliding bridges, and a high step. Weapons and armor you pick up stay with you, and that piece is not on the ground again.
        The glowing page in front of you is stamped with the public Hemi block from the moment you press start.
        An even block puts a Shard just behind the gate. An odd block puts a Hex there.
        The boss fires as you approach the gate. One shot, then two spaced shots, then a longer rest. It chases when it is hurt or you are down to two marks. Losing all five marks sends you back to the last checkpoint and costs 500 points. Librarians pace, hop, and spit acid. On Deep, Gale, and Crown that acid sits on the ground for a few seconds.
        The page score follows that same Hemi block.
        The chip stays on screen and stays read-only. Nothing here signs or spends.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="play" hidden>
    <header id="hud">
      <div class="hud-top">
        <div id="zone-name" class="zone-name">Hemi Rise</div>
        <div id="vital" class="vital" title="Health"></div>
        <div class="score-stack">
          <div id="score" class="score">0</div>
          <div id="stage-best" class="stage-best" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div id="inv" class="inv"></div>
        <button type="button" id="bag-open" class="quit bag-btn">Bag</button>
        <button type="button" id="quit" class="quit">Quit</button>
      </div>
      <div id="goal" class="goal"></div>
      <div id="chips" class="chips" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </header>
    <div id="stage">
      <div id="frame">
        <canvas id="view" width="480" height="270"></canvas>
        <div id="toast" role="status"></div>
        <div id="prompt"></div>
        <div id="stick-zone" aria-label="Thumb stick">
          <div id="stick-base"></div>
          <div id="stick-thumb"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pads">
          <button type="button" id="btn-shield" class="pad pad-shield">Guard</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-use" class="pad pad-use">Use</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-hit" class="pad pad-hit">Hit</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-jump" class="pad pad-jump">Jump</button>
        </div>
        <p class="kb frame-hint">Space jump · Ctrl or Down crouch · E hit · hold Q shield · wheel swaps · F uses · I armor</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="bag" class="bag" hidden>
      <div class="bag-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="bag-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Paused</p>
        <h2 id="bag-title">Armor</h2>
        <p class="bag-help">The zone is frozen. Click a piece you have found to wear it. Click it again to take it off. I or Esc goes back.</p>
        <div class="bag-look">
          <img id="bag-pilot" src="/assets/pilot.png" alt="" />
          <div class="look-slot">
            <img id="bag-chest" alt="" hidden />
            <p id="bag-chest-empty">No plate</p>
          </div>
          <div class="look-slot">
            <img id="bag-helm" alt="" hidden />
            <p id="bag-helm-empty">No helm</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p id="bag-caption"></p>
        <p id="bag-stat" class="bag-stat"></p>
        <div id="bag-grid" class="bag-grid"></div>
        <button type="button" id="bag-close" class="start">Back to the zone</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="win" hidden>
    <div class="select-wrap">
      <p id="win-eyebrow" class="eyebrow">Hemi Rise clear</p>
      <h1 id="win-title">Relay confirmed</h1>
      <p id="win-copy" class="lede"></p>
      <div id="win-chips" class="chips"></div>
      <button type="button" id="again" class="start">Run it again</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="reset-confirm" class="reset-confirm" hidden>
    <div class="reset-card" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="reset-title" aria-describedby="reset-body">
      <p class="eyebrow">Reset</p>
      <h2 id="reset-title">Forget your past?</h2>
      <p id="reset-body" class="bag-help">You lose touch with your Hemi power and start again from scratch. Your clears, gear, armor, and best scores on this device are gone. Orami is locked again.</p>
      <div class="reset-actions">
        <button type="button" id="reset-cancel" class="start">Keep my past</button>
        <button type="button" id="reset-yes" class="quit reset-yes">Forget</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <pre id="sim-out" hidden></pre>
  <script is:inline src="/wallet.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
